</filter></defs></svg><div class="glass-content"><div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full gap-9"><div class="flex items-center"><a aria-label="VoiceOS" class="flex items-center cursor-pointer relative" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-[26px] leading-none font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 opacity-100">VoiceOS</span><img alt="VoiceOS logo" aria-hidden="true" width="240" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[14px] md:h-[16px] w-auto opacity-0 absolute" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2FvoiceOsLogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2FvoiceOsLogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2FvoiceOsLogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></a></div><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-7"><div class="relative"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200">Product<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-px text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></button></div><a class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200" href="/about">About</a><a class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog">Blogs</a><a class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200" href="/app-store">App Store</a><a href="https://partners.dub.co/voice-os" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200">Affiliates</a><a href="https://api.voiceos.com/delivery/releases/primary/VoiceOS-Installer.dmg" class="nav-download-cta py-2 px-[18px] text-[15px] leading-[22px] rounded-full mr-[-1