s="relative z-10 block font-semibold text-gray-900">Blogs</span></a><a class="group relative block rounded-[22px] px-3.5 py-2.5 transition-colors duration-200" style="transition-delay:0ms;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-10px)" href="/app-store"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[22px] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 group-active:opacity-100" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.48)"></div><span class="relative z-10 block font-semibold text-gray-900">App Store</span></a><a href="https://partners.dub.co/voice-os" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative block rounded-[22px] px-3.5 py-2.5 transition-colors duration-200" style="transition-delay:0ms;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-10px)"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[22px] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 group-active:opacity-100" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.48)"></div><span class="relative z-10 block font-semibold text-gray-900">Affiliates</span></a></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-6 right-6 h-px pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(15,23,42,0.06), transparent)"></div></div></div></div></nav><div class="px-4 md:px-6 pt-32 md:pt-44 pb-16 md:pb-24"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto lg:grid lg:gap-10 lg:[grid-template-columns:220px_minmax(0,1fr)_60px]"><aside class="hidden lg:block"><div class="sticky top-32"><div class="rounded-xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#666]"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg><span>7 min read</span></div><p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">In this article</p><nav class="space-y-1"><a href="#key-takeaways" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Forty documented actions, with a check for each</a><a href="#gmail" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Gmail: Mac and Windows</a><a href="#slack" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Slack: Mac and Windows</a><a href="#google-calendar" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Google Calendar: Mac and Windows</a><a href="#apple-notes" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Notes: Mac</a><a href="#reminders" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Reminders: Mac</a><a href="#notion" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Notion: Mac and Windows</a><a href="#linear" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Linear: Mac and Windows</a><a href="#jira" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Jira: Mac and Windows</a><a href="#obsidian" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Obsidian: Mac and Windows</a><a href="#finder" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Finder: Mac</a><a href="#complete-task" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">How to turn a capability into evidence</a><a href="#frequently-asked-questions" class="block py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug transition-colors duration-200 border-l-2" style="padding-left:12px;border-color:transparent;color:#999;font-weight:400">Frequently asked questions</a></nav></div></div></aside><div class="min-w-0"><a class="mb-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-gray-900" href="/blog"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path></svg>All posts</a><div class="mb-6"><span style="color:#0369a1;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1">Guide</span></div><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.25rem);font-weight:600;line-height:1.15;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.03em">40 VoiceOS actions and how to verify each one</h1><p class="mt-5" style="font-size:clamp(1.125rem, 2.5vw, 1.375rem);font-weight:300;line-height:1.6;color:#555">VoiceOS maps each example to its official integration catalog, so you can see the action, the platform, the confirmation behavior, and what to check afterward.</p><div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-5 border-b border-[#eee] pb-8"><img alt="Andrew Hoffmann" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2FandrewBlogProfile.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2FandrewBlogProfile.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2FandrewBlogProfile.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><div><span class="mb-0.5 block text-xs text-[#999]">Written by</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Andrew Hoffmann</span></div><div class="border-l border-[#e5e5e5] pl-6"><span class="mb-0.5 block text-xs text-[#999]">Published</span><time dateTime="2026-09-30T07:00:00.000Z" class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">September 30, 2026</time></div></div></div><img alt="A smoked-glass speech bubble holds a flowing multicolor wave, connected to six quiet silver action tiles on a rich black surface." width="1536" height="1024" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mt-8 h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 900px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Feditorial%2Fvoice-agent-workflows-smoked-glass.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><article class="mt-12"><section id="key-takeaways" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-6 md:p-8"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1rem">Forty documented actions, with a check for each</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">VoiceOS’s integration catalog is the starting point for these examples. Every action below is matched to a tool definition in the shipped catalog, including its platform boundary and whether it asks first. That is source verification, not forty completed live tests.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-catalog" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 1">[<!-- -->1<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">The screenshots show VoiceOS in everyday use: drafting a Slack reply, preparing a note or reminder, working on a Notion request, finding videos, and drafting a Linear issue. Each image opens at full size. Preview and in-progress states are described where they appear.</p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Use disposable notes, events, files, and issues for an evaluation. Connect only the accounts you mean to use. The sample requests describe an intent; their success still depends on permissions, required fields, account state, and the product version.</p></div></div></section><section id="gmail" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Gmail: Mac and Windows</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Examples below require the Gmail integration and access to the intended destination. Check the linked catalog page for its setup and permissions.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-gmail" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 2">[<!-- -->2<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><figure class="mx-auto my-8 w-full"><a href="/posts/voiceos-email-workflow/email-draft.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View full-size image: Existing VoiceOS email demonstration with a composed message and recipient visible for review." class="relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600"><img alt="Existing VoiceOS email demonstration with a composed message and recipient visible for review." loading="lazy" width="1881" height="1222" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 920px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fposts%2Fvoiceos-email-workflow%2Femail-draft.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></a><figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]">An existing email demonstration shows the kind of result to inspect. The requests in this guide are authored examples, not recorded tests.</figcaption></figure><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white"><p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-500 md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to read all columns →</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left text-sm md:min-w-0"><thead class="bg-[#f5f5f5]"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Action</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Illustrative request</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Catalog behavior</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Verify the result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Read and search mail</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Find the email about the sample review</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check sender, subject, and thread against the inbox</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Look up contacts</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Look up the contact for the test recipient</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Verify the full address before using it</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Organize with labels</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Add the test label to this sample message</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check the intended label on the intended message</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Reply to a thread</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Prepare a reply to the sample thread</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Inspect the recipient and quoted thread before approving a send</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="px-4 pb-3"><sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-gmail" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 2">[<!-- -->2<!-- -->]</a></sup></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0"><span class="font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Sources &amp; further reading:</span> <span><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/gmail" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Gmail integration</a></span></p></div></section><section id="slack" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Slack: Mac and Windows</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Examples below require the Slack integration and access to the intended destination. Check the linked catalog page for its setup and permissions.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-slack" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 3">[<!-- -->3<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Say who you want to reach and what you want to say. In this example, “Can you send a message to Jonah on Slack saying I’m gonna be late?” produces a short draft with the conversation above it. The send button is still available so the message can be reviewed.</p><figure class="mx-auto my-8 w-full" style="max-width:640px"><a href="/blogs/guides/workflows/voiceos-slack.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View full-size image: VoiceOS shows a Slack message draft to Jonah: “Hey Jonah, I’m gonna be late,” with a send button." class="relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" style="aspect-ratio:1024 / 1000"><img alt="VoiceOS shows a Slack message draft to Jonah: “Hey Jonah, I’m gonna be late,” with a send button." loading="lazy" width="3024" height="1964" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute max-w-none" style="color:transparent;width:295.3125%;height:auto;left:-97.65625%;top:0%" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 296vw, 1890px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-slack.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></a><figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]">A spoken request becomes a Slack draft. Check the recipient and wording before sending.</figcaption></figure><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white"><p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-500 md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to read all columns →</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left text-sm md:min-w-0"><thead class="bg-[#f5f5f5]"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Action</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Illustrative request</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Catalog behavior</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Verify the result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Search messages</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Find the test message in the project channel</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Open the matched message and confirm the channel</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Read conversations</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Read the recent messages in the test channel</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check the returned channel and time range</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Send a message</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Prepare a message for the test channel</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Inspect the channel and body before approving</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Schedule a message</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Schedule the sample message for the agreed test time</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check channel, date, time zone, and scheduled-message state</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="px-4 pb-3"><sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-slack" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 3">[<!-- -->3<!-- -->]</a></sup></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0"><span class="font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Sources &amp; further reading:</span> <span><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/slack" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Slack integration</a></span></p></div></section><section id="google-calendar" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Google Calendar: Mac and Windows</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Examples below require the Google Calendar integration and access to the intended destination. Check the linked catalog page for its setup and permissions.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-google-calendar" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 4">[<!-- -->4<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white"><p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-500 md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to read all columns →</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left text-sm md:min-w-0"><thead class="bg-[#f5f5f5]"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Action</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Illustrative request</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Catalog behavior</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Verify the result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">See your schedule</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Show my test calendar for tomorrow</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check the selected calendar and date</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Find open time</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Find an open half hour on the test day</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Compare the proposed gap with the actual calendar</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create an event</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a test review event</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Verify calendar, attendees, time zone, start and end before approval</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Update an event</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Move the test review to the new agreed time</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Verify the exact event and the resulting time</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="px-4 pb-3"><sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-google-calendar" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 4">[<!-- -->4<!-- -->]</a></sup></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0"><span class="font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Sources &amp; further reading:</span> <span><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/google-calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Google Calendar integration</a></span></p></div></section><section id="apple-notes" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Notes: Mac</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Examples below require the Notes integration and access to the intended destination. Check the linked catalog page for its setup and permissions.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-apple-notes" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 5">[<!-- -->5<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Ask for a note while the idea is fresh. In this shopping-list example, the request becomes a titled draft with separate bullets. The visible portion shows eggs, tomatoes, and bread; review the full contents against everything you asked for, then choose Create Note.</p><figure class="mx-auto my-8 w-full" style="max-width:640px"><a href="/blogs/guides/workflows/voiceos-apple-notes.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View full-size image: VoiceOS previews a Shopping List note with visible bullets for eggs, tomatoes, and bread, plus a Create Note button." class="relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" style="aspect-ratio:1024 / 970"><img alt="VoiceOS previews a Shopping List note with visible bullets for eggs, tomatoes, and bread, plus a Create Note button." loading="lazy" width="3024" height="1964" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute max-w-none" style="color:transparent;width:295.3125%;height:auto;left:-97.65625%;top:0%" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 296vw, 1890px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-apple-notes.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></a><figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]">A spoken shopping list becomes a note preview with a title and separate bullet points. Review the full list before creating it.</figcaption></figure><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white"><p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-500 md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to read all columns →</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left text-sm md:min-w-0"><thead class="bg-[#f5f5f5]"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Action</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Illustrative request</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Catalog behavior</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Verify the result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Your folders</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">List my Notes folders</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check that the intended account and folder appear</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Search notes</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Find my sample project note</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Open the match and confirm its title</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a note</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a note for this sample idea</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check title, body, and destination folder</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Add to a note</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Add this sample paragraph to the test note</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check the existing note was appended to, not replaced</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="px-4 pb-3"><sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-apple-notes" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 5">[<!-- -->5<!-- -->]</a></sup></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0"><span class="font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Sources &amp; further reading:</span> <span><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/apple-notes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Notes integration</a></span></p></div></section><section id="reminders" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Reminders: Mac</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Examples below require the Reminders integration and access to the intended destination. Check the linked catalog page for its setup and permissions.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-reminders" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 6">[<!-- -->6<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Include the task and when you need it: “Remind me at 1:30 tomorrow to join the meeting. Use Apple Reminders.” The preview below shows the title, tomorrow’s date, and 1:30 PM before the Add Reminder step.</p><figure class="mx-auto my-8 w-full" style="max-width:640px"><a href="/blogs/guides/workflows/voiceos-reminders.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View full-size image: VoiceOS previews an Apple Reminder titled “Join the meeting” for tomorrow at 1:30 PM, with an Add Reminder button." class="relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" style="aspect-ratio:1024 / 800"><img alt="VoiceOS previews an Apple Reminder titled “Join the meeting” for tomorrow at 1:30 PM, with an Add Reminder button." loading="lazy" width="3024" height="1964" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute max-w-none" style="color:transparent;width:295.3125%;height:auto;left:-97.65625%;top:0%" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 296vw, 1890px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-reminders.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></a><figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]">“Remind me at 1:30 tomorrow to join the meeting.” The reminder preview puts the title, date, and time together.</figcaption></figure><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white"><p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-500 md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to read all columns →</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left text-sm md:min-w-0"><thead class="bg-[#f5f5f5]"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Action</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Illustrative request</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Catalog behavior</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Verify the result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Your lists</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Show my reminder lists</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Identify the correct test list</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Search reminders</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Find the sample follow-up reminder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check the matching reminder and list</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a reminder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a sample follow-up reminder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check text, list, and any requested due date</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Complete a reminder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Complete the test reminder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check that only the intended reminder is completed</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="px-4 pb-3"><sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-reminders" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 6">[<!-- -->6<!-- -->]</a></sup></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0"><span class="font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Sources &amp; further reading:</span> <span><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/reminders" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Reminders integration</a></span></p></div></section><section id="notion" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Notion: Mac and Windows</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Examples below require the Notion integration and access to the intended destination. Check the linked catalog page for its setup and permissions.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-notion" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 7">[<!-- -->7<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">You can describe the database task you want to change in ordinary language. This screenshot captures a request to mark a task urgent while VoiceOS is working. For your own tasks, name the exact record and database so the intended item is clear.</p><figure class="mx-auto my-8 w-full" style="max-width:640px"><a href="/blogs/guides/workflows/voiceos-notion.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View full-size image: VoiceOS is working on a request to change a task in a Notion knowledge-base table to urgent." class="relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" style="aspect-ratio:1024 / 570"><img alt="VoiceOS is working on a request to change a task in a Notion knowledge-base table to urgent." loading="lazy" width="3024" height="1964" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute max-w-none" style="color:transparent;width:295.3125%;height:auto;left:-97.65625%;top:0%" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 296vw, 1890px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-notion.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></a><figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]">A Notion request in progress. Check the task and priority in the database when the update finishes.</figcaption></figure><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white"><p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-500 md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to read all columns →</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left text-sm md:min-w-0"><thead class="bg-[#f5f5f5]"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Action</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Illustrative request</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Catalog behavior</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Verify the result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Search and read</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Find the sample project page</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Verify the workspace and page</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a page</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a sample planning page</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Inspect the parent page and content before approval</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Add content to a page</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Add a sample checklist to the test page</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Verify the target page and inserted content</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Query a database</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Show matching records in the test database</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check database, filter, and returned records</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="px-4 pb-3"><sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-notion" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 7">[<!-- -->7<!-- -->]</a></sup></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0"><span class="font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Sources &amp; further reading:</span> <span><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/notion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Notion integration</a></span></p></div></section><section id="linear" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Linear: Mac and Windows</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Examples below require the Linear integration and access to the intended destination. Check the linked catalog page for its setup and permissions.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-linear" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 8">[<!-- -->8<!-- -->]</a></sup></p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">With the relevant screen attached, ask “Can you create a Linear ticket for this?” Here the draft includes an expected-behavior description alongside status, priority, assignee, and team. Check those fields and the description before choosing Create.</p><figure class="mx-auto my-8 w-full" style="max-width:640px"><a href="/blogs/guides/workflows/voiceos-linear.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View full-size image: VoiceOS previews a Linear issue from attached screen context, showing an expected-behavior description, Todo status, High priority, assignee kai, team VoiceOS, and a Create button." class="relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" style="aspect-ratio:1024 / 1290"><img alt="VoiceOS previews a Linear issue from attached screen context, showing an expected-behavior description, Todo status, High priority, assignee kai, team VoiceOS, and a Create but