;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fblogs%2Fguides%2Fworkflows%2Fvoiceos-finder.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></a><figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]">Describe the file you need. Here, VoiceOS returns 13 video matches to inspect.</figcaption></figure><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white"><p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-500 md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to read all columns →</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[600px] text-left text-sm md:min-w-0"><thead class="bg-[#f5f5f5]"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Action</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Illustrative request</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Catalog behavior</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Verify the result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Browse a folder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">List the files in the test folder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Check the full folder path</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Get file info</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Show information for the sample file</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">No confirmation listed</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Verify the path and relevant file details</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a folder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Create a sample folder in the test directory</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Inspect the destination and verify the folder exists</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-[#eee]"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Copy</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Copy the sample file into the test folder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Asks first</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-[#444]">Confirm source and destination, and preserve the original</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="px-4 pb-3"><sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-finder" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 11">[<!-- -->11<!-- -->]</a></sup></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0"><span class="font-semibold text-[#0a0a0a]">Sources &amp; further reading:</span> <span><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/finder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Finder integration</a></span></p></div></section><section id="complete-task" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">How to turn a capability into evidence</h2><div class="space-y-6"><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">For each action you actually test, record the app version, operating system, integration, starting state, request, preview, result, and any manual repair. Inspect the destination instead of relying only on the assistant’s completion message. Keep failures in the record.</p><figure class="mx-auto my-8 w-full"><a href="/blogs/guides/actions.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View full-size image: Follow a voice request through the correct app, result review, and task completion." class="relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600"><img alt="Follow a voice request through the correct app, result review, and task completion." loading="lazy" width="1536" height="864" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/blogs/guides/actions.svg"/></a><figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#666]">A task is complete when the intended result is present in the right app and account.</figcaption></figure><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">A tool marked “No confirmation listed” may run without a separate approval step. Read operations and local writes are not equivalent, even if both have that label. Check the requested operation before invoking it, and keep your first tests limited to disposable material.</p><p style="font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">If you later publish a tested workflow, include a permissioned recording or transcript and a clear description of what succeeded. Until that evidence exists, describe it as a documented capability or proposed test. This distinction makes the catalog useful to a reader deciding what to try.</p></div></section><section id="related-voiceos-reading" class="mb-16 space-y-4"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0">Related: <span><a style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500" href="/blog/best-voice-assistants-mac-windows">Choose a voice assistant</a> · </span><span><a style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500" href="/blog/capture-ideas-without-losing-focus">An idea-capture workflow</a> · </span><span><a style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500" href="/blog/dictate-email-without-losing-control">A careful email workflow</a></span></p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5"><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin:0">VoiceOS resources: <span><a style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500" href="/pricing">VoiceOS plans</a> · </span><span><a style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500" href="/security">Privacy and security</a></span></p></div></section><section id="sources" class="mb-16"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Sources and methodology</h2><p class="mb-5" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Cross-checked all forty named actions, platform flags, and confirmation flags against the repository-generated official integration catalog on September 30, 2026.<!-- --> <!-- -->Limitations: <!-- -->These are documented capabilities and authored test cases. No claim is made that forty live account actions were executed or that sample wording always succeeds.</p><ol class="list-inside list-decimal space-y-3"><li id="source-catalog" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS official integration catalog</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-gmail" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/gmail" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Gmail integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-slack" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/slack" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Slack integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-google-calendar" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/google-calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Google Calendar integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-apple-notes" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/apple-notes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Notes integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-reminders" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/reminders" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Reminders integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-notion" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/notion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Notion integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-linear" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/linear" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Linear integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-jira" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/jira" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Jira integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-obsidian" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/obsidian" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Obsidian integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li><li id="source-finder" style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444"><a href="https://www.voiceos.com/app-store/finder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#0a0a0a40;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500">VoiceOS Finder integration</a> — <!-- -->VoiceOS</li></ol></section><aside class="mb-16 rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-[#666] md:p-6"><strong class="text-gray-900">How this was made:</strong> <!-- -->Published by VoiceOS, which makes one of the products discussed. AI-assisted research and drafting used the linked sources and VoiceOS product documentation. Recommendations are editorial judgments; examples are illustrative unless explicitly labeled as measured.</aside><section id="frequently-asked-questions" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-28"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="space-y-6"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><h3 style="font-size:clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 1.375rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;color:#0a0a0a;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Were all forty actions tested live for this article?</h3><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">No. Each action was checked against the shipped integration catalog. The verification steps are a test plan, not a record of completed end-to-end trials.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><h3 style="font-size:clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 1.375rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;color:#0a0a0a;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Do all actions ask before running?</h3><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">No. The table preserves the catalog’s per-tool confirmation behavior. Some local writes and read operations do not list a separate confirmation.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-catalog" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 1">[<!-- -->1<!-- -->]</a></sup></p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><h3 style="font-size:clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 1.375rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;color:#0a0a0a;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Why do some sections say Mac only?</h3><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.8;color:#444">Native Apple integrations in the catalog have a Mac-specific platform requirement. A VoiceOS Windows installation does not add those Apple-only integrations.<sup class="ml-1"><a href="#source-catalog" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" aria-label="Source 1">[<!-- -->1<!-- -->]</a></sup></p></div></div></section><section class="mb-8"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-[#e5edf8] bg-[#F5F9FF] px-6 py-14 text-[#0a0a0a] md:py-20"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:url(/oceanWarp.webp);background-position:center;background-size:cover"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-white/70"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 120% at 50% 50%, transparent 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.85) 100%)"></div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.375rem, 4vw, 1.75rem);font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Start with one real task</h2><p style="font-size:0.9375rem;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.58)">See how VoiceOS handles dictation, editing, and supported app actions on Mac and Windows.</p><a class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-black/[0.06] bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#111] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0_8px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)]" href="/features/dictation">Explore VoiceOS<svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></article></div><aside class="hidden lg:block"><div class="sticky top-32"><div class="flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-2"><button style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;background-color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 0.2s, background-color 0.2s" title="Share on X" aria-label="Share on X"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#0a0a0a"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path></svg></button><button style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;background-color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 0.2s, background-color 0.2s" title="Share on Facebook" aria-label="Share on Facebook"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#0a0a0a"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385